Advanced Container Security
Learning Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

• Understand the fundamentals of DevSecOps pipeline implementation • Implement container image vulnerability scanning using Trivy • Digitally sign Docker images using Notary for enhanced security • Deploy signed container images to DockerHub registry • Create and configure a Kubernetes cluster for secure container orchestration • Implement runtime security controls using SecComp and AppArmor profiles • Integrate security best practices throughout the container lifecycle

